    slug: "real-estate-agent-marketing-canada",
    title: "Real Estate Agent Marketing in Canada: REALTOR.ca, RECO Rules and Seller Leads",
    excerpt: "How Canadian agents, teams and brokerages win listings in 2026: REALTOR.ca and the DDF feed, the three-day Cooperation Policy, seller-lead Google Ads in CAD, RECO, BCFSA, RECA and OACIQ advertising rules, FINTRAC on lead forms, pre-construction marketing and a Bank of Canada seasonality calendar.",
    category: "Industry Guides",
