    excerpt: "How Canadian physiotherapy, chiropractic and rehab clinics win new patients in 2026: Map Pack booking links, direct-billing pages, WSIB, WCB, ICBC and SAAQ referral channels, TELUS eClaims as a directory, ad costs in CAD and college advertising rules by province.",
